      "title": "Putin begins talks with Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner on ending war with Ukraine",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks",
      "description": "<p>Moscow and Kyiv vow not to strike each other’s capitals for three days during negotiations </p><p>Russian president Vladimir Putin began talks with US envoys Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff in the Kremlin on Saturday – aimed at ending more than four years of war in Ukraine, ahead of the pair’s first visit to Kyiv expected on Sunday.</p><p>Both Russia and Ukraine vowed not to strike each other’s capitals for three days during the negotiations, as Washington tries to revive US-led talks to end Europe’s worst conflict since the second world war.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-05T22:13:55"
    },
