      "title": "Russia’s Putin and US envoys discuss Trump proposal to end Ukraine war",
      "link": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/5/russias-putin-meets-us-envoys-to-discuss-trump-proposal-to-end-ukraine-war?traffic_source=rss",
      "description": "Kremlin aide calls the Moscow talks &#039;very frank and constructive&#039;, as US envoys head to Kyiv next.",
